{
  "slug": "karma",
  "name": "Karma",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Karma is a plugin for managing grants, projects, and funding programs on the Karma protocol. Discover funding opportunities across Web3 ecosystems, create and manage projects with milestones, track grant progress, and administer funding programs, all through natural conversation. No blockchain transactions needed; everything is gasless via API.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `find-funding-opportunities` (Search the Karma Funding Map for funding programs (grants, hackathons, bounties, accelerators, VC funds, RFPs) via the public…), `funding-program-manager` (Create and manage funding programs on Karma — create programs in the registry, configure intake forms, apply to…), `project-manager` (Manage projects, grants, milestones, and updates on the Karma protocol), `setup-agent` (Set up or log in to Karma), `skill-creator` (Create new Claude Code skills for the Karma ecosystem)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install karma@claude-community` from `show-karma/skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 5,
    "hook": 1
  },
